# Assumptions: the family has an autosomal dominant variant with incomplete penetrance.
# Unaffected II-1 is an obligate carrier because their affected child inherited the variant through them.
pedigree "Incomplete penetrance with obligate carriers"
  I-1 [male, affected]
  I-2 [female, unaffected]
  I-1 -- I-2
    II-1 [female, obligate-carrier]
    II-2 [male, affected]
  II-3 [male, unaffected]
  II-1 -- II-3
    III-1 [male, affected, proband]
    III-2 [female, unaffected]
